@smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5011
@accessToken = REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN
@refreshToken = REPLACE_WITH_REFRESH_TOKEN
@invitationToken = REPLACE_WITH_INVITATION_TOKEN
@userId = REPLACE_WITH_USER_ID
@prosumerNic = 200012345678
@nodeId = REPLACE_WITH_NODE_ID
@reservationId = REPLACE_WITH_RESERVATION_ID
@transactionToken = REPLACE_WITH_TRANSACTION_TOKEN
@transactionId = REPLACE_WITH_TRANSACTION_ID

### Login (use the seeded super-admin credentials, or any Active account)
# 401 error codes on failure: InvalidCredentials (unknown email or wrong password),
# ProfileIncomplete (invited but hasn't accepted their invitation yet), AccountDeactivated,
# ProsumerMobileOnly (the email belongs to a Prosumer profile — the web dashboard is
# Backoffice/Grid Operator only; returned regardless of whether the password is correct)
POST {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "ChangeMe123!"
}

###

### Prosumer login (mobile-only; NicOrEmail accepts either identifier)
# 401 error codes on failure: InvalidCredentials, PendingApproval (self-registration awaiting
# review), AccountCreationDenied (denied), AccountDeactivated, PasswordNotSet (Invited - either
# staff-created awaiting the web accept-invitation flow, or approved awaiting the mobile
# reset-password flow via the same POST /api/v1/auth/accept-invitation endpoint)
POST {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/prosumer/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nicOrEmail": "{{prosumerNic}}",
  "password": "ChangeMe123!"
}

###

### Refresh (rotates the presented refresh token; works for both staff and prosumer tokens)
POST {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

###

### Logout (revokes the presented refresh token)
POST {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

###

### Accept invitation (from the link emailed via MailHog, http://localhost:8025)
# 200 response body: { "accountType": "User" | "Prosumer" } — the frontend uses this to decide
# whether to show "sign in to the dashboard" or "sign in via the mobile app" next
POST {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/accept-invitation
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "{{invitationToken}}",
  "newPassword": "SetByInvitedUser123!"
}

###

### Get own profile (any authenticated user)
GET {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Create a Backoffice account (Backoffice-only)
POST {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/users/backoffice
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "new.backoffice@example.com",
  "username": "New Backoffice User"
}

###

### Create a Grid Operator account (Backoffice-only)
POST {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/users/grid-operators
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "new.operator@example.com",
  "username": "New Grid Operator"
}

###

### List all users (Backoffice-only)
GET {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/users/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Update a user's email/username (Backoffice-only)
PUT {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "updated.operator@example.com",
  "username": "Updated Name"
}

###

### Delete a user permanently (Backoffice-only)
DELETE {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Deactivate a user (Backoffice-only; blocked for the seeded super-admin)
PATCH {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/users/{{userId}}/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Reactivate a user (Backoffice-only)
PATCH {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/users/{{userId}}/reactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Create a prosumer profile (Backoffice or Grid Operator); sends a setup invitation email
# rather than accepting a password directly — accept it via POST /api/v1/auth/accept-invitation
# (same endpoint used for Backoffice/Grid Operator invitations), using the token from the email
# 400 error codes: InvalidNic, ValidEmailRequired
# 409 error codes: NicAlreadyInUse, EmailAlreadyInUse
POST {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/prosumers
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nic": "{{prosumerNic}}",
  "email": "new.prosumer@example.com",
  "fullName": "New Prosumer"
}

###

### Self-register a prosumer profile from the mobile app (public - no auth). No password: the
# profile starts PendingApproval and awaits a Backoffice/Grid Operator reviewer (see approve/deny
# below); the prosumer sets a password afterwards via POST /api/v1/auth/accept-invitation, using
# the code emailed on approval
# 400 error codes: InvalidNic, ValidEmailRequired
# 409 error codes: NicAlreadyInUse, EmailAlreadyInUse
POST {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/prosumers/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nic": "{{prosumerNic}}",
  "email": "new.prosumer@example.com",
  "fullName": "New Prosumer",
  "phone": "+94771234567",
  "address": "123 Galle Road, Colombo"
}

###

### List prosumers with backend search, status filter, and pagination (Backoffice or Grid Operator)
# use status=PendingApproval to list self-registration requests awaiting review
GET {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/prosumers?search=prosumer&status=Active&page=1&pageSize=20&sortBy=CreatedAt&sortDir=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Approve a self-registered prosumer's PendingApproval request (Backoffice or Grid Operator);
# moves it to Invited and emails a reset-password code for the mobile app (not a web link)
# 409 error codes: NotPendingApproval
PATCH {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/prosumers/{{prosumerNic}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Deny a self-registered prosumer's PendingApproval request, optionally with a reason
# (Backoffice or Grid Operator); terminal - moves it to Rejected
# 409 error codes: NotPendingApproval
PATCH {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/prosumers/{{prosumerNic}}/deny
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "NIC details could not be verified"
}

###

### Update a prosumer's email/full name (Backoffice or Grid Operator); NIC is immutable
PUT {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/prosumers/{{prosumerNic}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "updated.prosumer@example.com",
  "fullName": "Updated Name"
}

###

### Deactivate a prosumer profile (Backoffice or Grid Operator)
PATCH {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/prosumers/{{prosumerNic}}/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Reactivate a prosumer profile (Backoffice-only; Grid Operators get 403)
PATCH {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/prosumers/{{prosumerNic}}/reactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Create a microgrid node (Backoffice-only). operatingStartTime/operatingEndTime seed the same
# daily window on every day of the initial weekly schedule (refine per-day later via PATCH
# /{id}/schedule)
# 400 error codes: NameRequired, InvalidLatitude, InvalidLongitude, CapacityMustBePositive,
# BatterySlotCountMustNotBeNegative, OperatingStartTimeMustBeBeforeEndTime
POST {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/nodes
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Colombo Hub 1",
  "latitude": 6.9271,
  "longitude": 79.8612,
  "capacityKw": 50.5,
  "batterySlotCount": 5,
  "operatingStartTime": "06:00:00",
  "operatingEndTime": "18:00:00"
}

###

### List microgrid nodes with backend search, status filter, and pagination (Backoffice or Grid Operator)
GET {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/nodes?search=hub&status=Active&page=1&pageSize=20&sortBy=CreatedAt&sortDir=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Get a single microgrid node (Backoffice or Grid Operator)
GET {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/nodes/{{nodeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Prosumer self-service: browse Active nodes only (Prosumer role; use a prosumer's own access
# token from POST /api/v1/auth/prosumer/login) - to pick a node/slot when submitting a reservation
# request (see POST /api/v1/reservations/mine)
GET {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/nodes/mine?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Prosumer self-service: get a single Active node (Prosumer role); 404 if it doesn't exist or
# is Deactivated
GET {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/nodes/mine/{{nodeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Update a node's weekly operating-hours schedule (Backoffice-only)
# 400 error codes: OpenAndCloseTimeRequiredWhenNotClosed, OpenTimeMustBeBeforeCloseTime
PATCH {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/nodes/{{nodeId}}/schedule
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "schedule": [
    { "dayOfWeek": "Monday", "openTime": "06:00:00", "closeTime": "18:00:00", "isClosed": false },
    { "dayOfWeek": "Sunday", "openTime": null, "closeTime": null, "isClosed": true }
  ]
}

###

### Update a battery slot's status (Backoffice or Grid Operator)
# 404 error codes: SlotNotFound
PATCH {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/nodes/{{nodeId}}/battery-slots/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Occupied"
}

###

### Deactivate a microgrid node (Backoffice-only)
# 409 error codes: ActiveReservationsExist (blocked while a Confirmed, not-yet-elapsed reservation
# exists against the node — see ReservationLookupService)
PATCH {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/nodes/{{nodeId}}/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Reactivate a microgrid node (Backoffice-only)
PATCH {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/nodes/{{nodeId}}/reactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Create an energy slot reservation (Backoffice or Grid Operator; staff-assisted booking on the
# prosumer's behalf, immediately Confirmed - see POST /mine below for prosumer self-service, which
# starts Pending instead). startTime must be in the future and no more than 7 days out (spec
# section 3.4); the target slot must have no other Confirmed, not-yet-elapsed reservation against it.
# 400 error codes: InvalidNic, NodeIdRequired, SlotIdRequired, StartTimeMustBeBeforeEndTime,
# ReservationMustBeInFuture, ReservationMustBeWithinSevenDays
# 404 error codes: ProsumerNotFound, NodeNotFound, SlotNotFound
# 409 error codes: ProsumerDeactivated, NodeDeactivated, SlotNotAvailable
POST {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prosumerNic": "{{prosumerNic}}",
  "nodeId": "{{nodeId}}",
  "slotId": "1",
  "startTime": "2026-09-22T09:00:00Z",
  "endTime": "2026-09-22T11:00:00Z"
}

###

### List reservations with backend filters and pagination (Backoffice or Grid Operator);
# use status=Pending to list prosumer-submitted requests awaiting review (see approve/reject below)
GET {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/reservations?status=Confirmed&page=1&pageSize=20&sortBy=StartTime&sortDir=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Get a single reservation (Backoffice or Grid Operator)
GET {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/reservations/{{reservationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Reschedule a reservation's time window (Backoffice or Grid Operator); same node/slot are kept.
# Requires at least 12 hours' notice against the reservation's current (pre-update) start time.
# 400 error codes: StartTimeMustBeBeforeEndTime, ReservationMustBeInFuture, ReservationMustBeWithinSevenDays
# 409 error codes: AlreadyCancelled, AlreadyStarted, InsufficientNotice
PATCH {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/reservations/{{reservationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startTime": "2026-09-23T09:00:00Z",
  "endTime": "2026-09-23T11:00:00Z"
}

###

### Cancel a reservation (Backoffice or Grid Operator); requires at least 12 hours' notice against
# the reservation's current start time
# 409 error codes: AlreadyCancelled, AlreadyStarted, InsufficientNotice
PATCH {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/reservations/{{reservationId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Approve a Pending prosumer-submitted reservation request (Backoffice or Grid Operator); moves
# it to Confirmed and marks the node's slot Reserved, after re-checking the slot is still free
# 409 error codes: NotPending, SlotNoLongerAvailable
PATCH {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/reservations/{{reservationId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Reject a Pending prosumer-submitted reservation request, optionally with a reason
# (Backoffice or Grid Operator); terminal - moves it to Rejected
# 409 error codes: NotPending
PATCH {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/reservations/{{reservationId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Slot needed for scheduled maintenance"
}

###

### Prosumer self-service: submit a reservation request (Prosumer role; use a prosumer's own
# access token from POST /api/v1/auth/prosumer/login). Starts Pending - awaits a Backoffice/Grid
# Operator reviewer above. Identity comes from the JWT, not the body.
# 400 error codes: NodeIdRequired, SlotIdRequired, StartTimeMustBeBeforeEndTime,
# ReservationMustBeInFuture, ReservationMustBeWithinSevenDays
# 404 error codes: NodeNotFound, SlotNotFound
# 409 error codes: ProsumerDeactivated, NodeDeactivated, SlotNotAvailable
POST {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/reservations/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nodeId": "{{nodeId}}",
  "slotId": "1",
  "startTime": "2026-09-22T09:00:00Z",
  "endTime": "2026-09-22T11:00:00Z",
  "energyAmount": 5.5
}

###

### Prosumer self-service: list only the caller's own reservations (Prosumer role)
GET {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/reservations/mine?page=1&pageSize=20&sortBy=StartTime&sortDir=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Prosumer self-service: get one of the caller's own reservations (Prosumer role)
GET {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/reservations/mine/{{reservationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Prosumer self-service: reschedule one of the caller's own reservations (Prosumer role); same
# 12-hour notice / 7-day window rules as the staff reschedule endpoint
# 409 error codes: AlreadyCancelled, AlreadyStarted, InsufficientNotice
PATCH {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/reservations/mine/{{reservationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startTime": "2026-09-23T09:00:00Z",
  "endTime": "2026-09-23T11:00:00Z"
}

###

### Prosumer self-service: cancel one of the caller's own reservations (Prosumer role)
# 409 error codes: AlreadyCancelled, AlreadyStarted, InsufficientNotice
PATCH {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/reservations/mine/{{reservationId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Prosumer self-service: generate a QR Energy Transfer Pass for one of the caller's own
# Confirmed reservations (Prosumer role). The response's "token" is the raw, one-time QR payload -
# copy it into @transactionToken below to test scan/complete.
# 404 error codes: ReservationNotFound
# 409 error codes: ReservationNotConfirmed, ReservationWindowElapsed
POST {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/transactions/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reservationId": "{{reservationId}}"
}

###

### Grid Operator scans a QR pass (Grid-Operator-only "TransactionFinalization" policy); returns
# display-ready reservation/prosumer/slot details for a confirmation screen. The response's "id"
# is the transaction id - copy it into @transactionId below to complete it.
# 404 error codes: NotFound
# 409 error codes: AlreadyUsed, Expired, ReservationNoLongerConfirmed
POST {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/transactions/scan
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "{{transactionToken}}"
}

###

### Grid Operator finalizes a previously-scanned pass (Grid-Operator-only); moves the reservation
# to Completed and releases the node's slot back to Available
# 404 error codes: NotFound
# 409 error codes: NotScanned
PATCH {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/transactions/{{transactionId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Dashboard summary: node/battery-slot/today's-reservation-dispatch/prosumer counts
# (Backoffice or Grid Operator)
GET {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/dashboard/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Dashboard recent activity: merged feed of recent node/prosumer/reservation creations, default
# 10 items (Backoffice or Grid Operator)
GET {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/dashboard/recent-activity?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###
